# Compiled test binaries. A pattern, not a list: every new test used to
# need a line here, and the one that got forgotten showed up as an
# untracked 20 MB binary in someone else's git status. Sources keep their
# extension, so un-ignoring anything with a dot leaves them tracked.
tests/test_*
!tests/test_*.*
